      "name": "Entry tickets (HU-01) — esqueleto",
      "description": "",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "[STUB] Emitir ticket de entrada",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrlTicket}}/v1/entry-tickets",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrlTicket}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "entry-tickets"
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST /v1/entry-tickets. **Devuelve 200 con cuerpo vacio** (`return null` en `createEntryTicket`).\n\nEl DTO declarado es `EntryTicketRequest(UUID stayId)` — solo `stayId`. Pero `StayTicketClientAdapter` manda ademas `plate` e `issuedAt`; hay que decidir cual es el contrato bueno antes de implementarlo.\n\nRespuesta esperada cuando exista: `EntryTicketResponse(id, stayId, code, issuedAt, status)` -> 201.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"stayId\": \"{{stayId}}\",\n  \"plate\": \"{{plate}}\",\n  \"issuedAt\": \"2026-07-23T08:00:00Z\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('el endpoint responde (aun sin implementar)', () =>",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
                  "pm.test('SIGUE SIN IMPLEMENTAR: cuerpo vacio', () =>",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.be.empty);",
                  "// Cuando este implementado, este ultimo test fallara.",
                  "// Eso es la señal de que toca actualizar la coleccion."
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
